Description:

Revoking a user's DAV access to a shared calendar or addressbook now also
drops that user's subscription to the share.  Previously, a sharee whose
access had been revoked lost their access to the collection but remained
subscribed to it, so alarms -- including event titles, times, and locations
-- continued to be delivered to them.

Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-2pch-vwxc-h4mm.


